---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TsundokuNavbar from '../../../components/tsundoku/TsundokuNavbar.astro';
import tsundokuIcon from '../../../assets/icons/tsundokuicon.png';
import tsundokuIconDark from '../../../assets/icons/tsundokuicon-dark.png';
---

<Layout
	title="privacy policy"
	iconLightHref={tsundokuIcon.src}
	iconDarkHref={tsundokuIconDark.src}
	iconLightType="image/png"
	iconDarkType="image/png"
	appleTouchIconHref={tsundokuIcon.src}
>
	<div class="w-full z-50">
		<TsundokuNavbar />
	</div>
	<div class="mt-12 px-[clamp(1rem,16vw,12rem)] pb-20 font-['Georgia_Pro',Georgia,serif] text-[#222] dark:text-neutral-100">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
			<h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-4 text-center">Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="text-center text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-10">
				Last updated: March 2026
			</p>

			<div class="space-y-6 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
				<section class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 p-6 sm:p-7">
					<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-2">1. Overview</h2>
					<p>
						Tsundoku Reader ("us", "we", or "our") operates this Service. This page explains our policies regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of information when you use Tsundoku Reader.
					</p>
					<p class="mt-3">
						At this time, Tsundoku Reader is designed to function without collecting personal data. If this changes in order to improve the Service, those changes will be described in this policy before they take effect.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 p-6 sm:p-7">
					<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-2">2. Information Collection and Use</h2>
					<p>
						Currently, we do not ask you to provide personally identifiable information such as your name, email address, phone number, or account credentials.
					</p>
					<p class="mt-3">
						If future versions add optional service-improvement features, we may collect limited diagnostic or usage data to improve app quality, reliability, and performance. Any such data practices will be updated here first.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 p-6 sm:p-7">
					<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-2">3. Log Data</h2>
					<p>
						At present, we do not collect log data tied to users.
					</p>
					<p class="mt-3">
						If enabled in the future, log data may include technical details such as IP address, device type, operating system version, app version, pages/screens viewed, timestamps, and basic interaction statistics for debugging and service improvement.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 p-6 sm:p-7">
					<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-2">4. Analytics and Third-Party Services</h2>
					<p>
						Tsundoku Reader currently does not use advertising SDKs or user-tracking analytics.
					</p>
					<p class="mt-3">
						If we integrate third-party analytics or crash-monitoring tools in the future, they will only be used to improve functionality and stability, and this policy will be updated to list those providers and their data practices.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 p-6 sm:p-7">
					<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-2">5. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
					<p>
						This Service currently does not use cookies for tracking users.
					</p>
					<p class="mt-3">
						If cookie-like technologies are introduced later (for essential functionality or aggregate analytics), we will update this policy to explain what is used and why.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 p-6 sm:p-7">
					<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-2">6. Business Transfers</h2>
					<p>
						If Tsundoku Reader is involved in a merger, acquisition, or asset sale, information may be transferred as part of that transaction. If this applies in the future, notice will be provided before any new privacy terms take effect.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 p-6 sm:p-7">
					<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-2">7. Security</h2>
					<p>
						We take reasonable steps to protect the Service. However, no transmission method over the Internet and no electronic storage system is completely secure.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 p-6 sm:p-7">
					<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-2">8. International Data Transfers</h2>
					<p>
						Because we currently do not collect personal information, no routine international transfer of personal data occurs.
					</p>
					<p class="mt-3">
						If data collection is introduced in the future, your information may be processed in jurisdictions where our infrastructure or service providers operate, and this policy will be updated accordingly.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 p-6 sm:p-7">
					<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-2">9. External Links</h2>
					<p>
						The Service may contain links to external sites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of third-party websites and encourage you to review their policies.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 p-6 sm:p-7">
					<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-2">10. Children's Privacy</h2>
					<p>
						The Service is not intentionally directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you are a parent or guardian and you are aware that your Children has provided us with Personal Information, please contact us. If we become aware that we have collected Personal Information from a children under age 13 without verification of parental consent, we take steps to remove that information from our servers.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 p-6 sm:p-7">
					<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-2">11. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
					<p>
						We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Updates will be posted on this page with a revised "Last updated" date.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 p-6 sm:p-7">
					<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-2">12. Contact</h2>
					<p>
						If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact the developer through Discord.
					</p>
				</section>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
	html, body {
		overscroll-behavior: none;
	}
</style>
